   "description": "Very-high-resolution optical imagery available for the event, from the Vantor (formerly Maxar) Open Data STAC collection. Enumerated directly from the STAC API on 2026-08-29. Footprint coverage of the detachment source and of Syabrubesi was tested by point-in-polygon against each scene geometry.",
